  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Multiple countries &#x2013; Capacity building hubs ecosystem support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to build the capacity of the Orange Corners&apos; (OC) implementing partners in the 20 Orange Corners Incubation and Acceleration (OCIAC) countries, as ecosystem builders in their respective ecosystems.The project will be spearheaded by Startup Genome, a world-leading startup policy advisory and research firm, based in the USA, who will develop and deliver an online training programme to strengthen the knowledge of OC implementers to understand their ecosystems, their position and role within.Further, this project aims to train them to analysing and designing interventions to strengthen their respective ecosystems in order to create a more sustainable business climate.</narrative>
  </description>
